OL,3,GNEWSA'I started ketamine at 14 and
OL,4,Aneeded nappies at 22' - the rise of
OL,5,Ayoung people going to rehab
OL,6,
OL,7,FMegan Harmes was 14 when she first
OL,8,Ftried ketamine.
OL,10,FA decade later, rehab is helping her
OL,11,Frebuild her life after bladder issues
OL,12,Fcaused by the drug have left her
OL,13,Fneeding to wear incontinence pads.
OL,15,FThe drugs charity Kaleidoscope says it
OL,16,Fhas seen a huge rise in referrals to
OL,17,Fits detox and rehabilitation facility
OL,18,Fover the last five years, with two
OL,19,Fpeople referred in 2021 compared with
OL,20,F112 so far this year. The majority of
OL,21,Fclients are aged 18 to 24.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
