OL,3,GNEWSA'I started ketamine at 14 and
OL,4,Aneeded nappies at 22' - the rise of
OL,5,Ayoung people going to rehab
OL,6,
OL,7,FResearch is now under way by the
OL,8,FUniversity of South Wales into the
OL,9,Fspecific needs of this group, as the
OL,10,Fharm caused by "chronic, escalating
OL,11,Fuse" of ketamine is far more rapid,
OL,12,Fover a shorter space of time, than that
OL,13,Ffrom alcohol or Class A drugs.
